  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What I found instead was this young Qhat, who has disturbing revelations about what's underway at the Chronoverge.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_55.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC17_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Indeed. Wizard, perhaps you remember me from Xerxes' Tomb? After we parted, I returned to the Chronoverge, but soon learned a terrible truth.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378223,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC17_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Chronomaster Devlin and the others are all part of some group known as the Cabal. They've seized control and reversed the Sands of Time.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378223,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC17_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Even if were I able to get back into the Chronoverge and defeat them, I wouldn't have the foggiest notion of how to set things aright again.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ChronomancerTyrehl_MIR_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378223,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There may yet be a way. At the Spiral's Dawn, it's said Grandmother Raven safeguarded the Secrets of Time with a being known as the Chronocle.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_56.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
